<title>Venezuela and the Caribbean: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/venezuela/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-venezuela-2026-10-14T17:24:47.028Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 17:24:47 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The United States has eased sanctions on Venezuela’s National Assembly leader, while a New York court set a June trial for ousted President Nicolás Maduro. Medical neglect in a Venezuelan prison led to the death of inmate Alfredo Díaz, and workers’ protests over hunger and living-standard collapse continue across the country. Cuba’s grid collapse is deepening regional energy strain, and a major oil deal is being halted, reducing power in Venezuela. 2 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxOOTlvMUpXbDJXOFQ2QXFGcm03VjFVMEx6anJzUkZIc2c1Ml84dWU5SkFKODUzelpWbnQ3UnIxY3NYZWpNaFcxV01jaTZwckZyLVlBRll1b1kxUGhseGpoV0M0RERCNlJQLWNmRnl0SFFWT2JRanlpQXJjZlNycWc5ZUhTMA?oc=5&quot;&gt;AFP.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxPZ1lFMnZBTXJ2UC1VZG96Mk1UMHZmS2JjWXBwZDFBME9HRC1tX0U2RC1wR2h2RGgzdlhYU3hwaXhnTVctclY5dDVPYU9NeWhCalgxWHNscEtmTW83a0IxSmZEdkdnOEk3UkstUVBzcWJGc1JmaGp3NGEtczRzYXJJWG1fY0NOQ25tSjFtM0tzY2xBY200Qlg2UFFvRk13NTdBSDZWTDZEeEhjbHlDdHA2VXVUUkNnNVFZbVFsenNMVldLRGJoMkYyaA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Trinidad Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxORzZIUm1ZM2hkWVlMRFM1eWRTSHVNeDhoWHgwMTBMV0RCX21RckdNSkVvM1AxeUIySjliN1pSYno2OG0zdXpwYVFYaEFqVWdWQTlnSVM2OUlvUHBfSHNPVHU2M3A5Y1JFRG1QN3loUGUweWs1MVQyZUhpaTg0bjVfaDlEeUYxeHpFTzFtSTNGVlpnam5vUHBoeTRmNEFMdlpYU1kzTlJhOERpamdDczBWNWF3N3g2WFM2aG9JblBOVHhFdlpzR3ktM3psNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Trinidad Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxOX0dPTzMxQmZlR2ROS0E2T3czWFg4ZVNHb1A3NG9fdmFsQzdhSG5YOTBMVHgxZzEyeTJpaWZYMHNuaW52WlZmNHItb1hmR2xha1ZtemVjSkw4U2psUzdNRVFGTmFUQXVJRmJudGVPMzFSRnFtSUhrQ1F3b3lvTER